 "script": "Missed the GTA 6 festival lottery? One door is still open. Rockstar's launch party is November 21 in Miami, with Travis Scott, Cardi B and Metro Boomin. Tickets are $60, two per person, 17 plus. The lottery closed November 10th, but there's a waitlist on DICE. When a winner can't go, they relist at the same price, and the waitlist buys in order. Sell a ticket off the app and it's cancelled, no refund. Would you pay $60 to party with GTA 6? Comment below.",
